.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>A6 (Laboratory information systems)</td><td>v1 'Laboratory and Diagnostic System' → v2 A6 'Laboratory information systems'</td></tr><tr><td>S (Learning and Training System)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>B5 (Learning and training systems)</td><td>v1 'Learning and Training System' → v2 B5 'Learning and training systems'</td></tr><tr><td>T (Logistics Management Information System)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>B6 (Logistics management information systems (LMIS))</td><td>v1 'Logistics Management Information System' → v2 B6 'Logistics management information systems [LMIS]'</td></tr><tr><td>U (Pharmacy Information System)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>A8 (Pharmacy information systems)</td><td>v1 'Pharmacy Information System' → v2 A8 'Pharmacy information systems'</td></tr><tr><td>V (Public health and disease surveillance)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>E2 (Public health and disease surveillance systems)</td><td>v1 'Public health and disease surveillance' → v2 E2 'Public health and disease surveillance systems'</td></tr><tr><td>W (Research information system)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>B8 (Research information systems)</td><td>v1 'Research information system' → v2 B8 'Research information systems'</td><